\cf0 \strokec2 I don't think the evidence available can justify predicting a huge audience. You haven't yet tested the actual live production, and there are many unknowns about your delivery, existing audience, and public response.\
But there is enough distinctiveness here that I wouldn't recommend starting by making the concept more conventional.\
I would recommend making it easier to enter.\
